  "$comment": "Shared, language-agnostic test vectors for CKD-EPI 2021 (race-free creatinine refit). Derived from Inker GJ et al. N Engl J Med 2021;385(19):1737-1749, doi 10.1056/NEJMoa2102953. Field names match standard clinical parameters.",
  "calculator": "ckd-epi-2021",
